faq:
  - q: Can a surveyor use it on a phone?
    a: Yes. The survey runs in a mobile browser. It captures the visit's location, roof, electrical and structural details and categorised photos, and the surveyor completes it on site.
  - q: How is the bill of materials priced?
    a: From your own material catalogue. Rules on each item set the quantity, for example per kW, per panel, per string or per metre of cable, and each line carries its GST rate.
  - q: Who can see our margins?
    a: Only people with the internal costing permission. Other users see the customer prices they need and nothing about base cost or margin.
  - q: Can we revise a quotation after sending it?
    a: Yes. A revision creates a new version with a reason, and the earlier versions stay on the record.
  - q: What does the customer receive?
    a: A proposal that shows project cost, subsidy, net payable, estimated generation, savings, payback years and environmental impact, along with your terms.
